Compliance Report Lambda Function

Overview

This AWS Lambda function generates a compliance report by collecting information about AWS environment, specifically on S3 bucket policies and IAM roles.


What it Does

Lists all S3 buckets in the AWS account.
Retrieves the bucket policy for each S3 bucket.
Lists all IAM roles in the AWS account.
Compiles this information into a JSON report.
Saves the report as a JSON file in a specified S3 bucket.
The report filename includes a timestamp to ensure uniqueness.